Well apprearing.  
BP 148/92 → 145/90 (R arm, seated, after rest).  
HR 76 reg, RR 14, SpO2 99% RA, afeb.  
CVS dual HS, no murmur, no oedema. Chest clear. Abd soft, non-tender, mild bloating only.  

