- Brief rev of low‑lactose approach (avoid large ammounts of high lactose foods; small ammounts / hard cheese usually ok; use lactase tabs when planning to “push it”).  
- Keep Ca intake via lactose free/fortified products + current supplement.  
- Refer to APD dietitian (local) – letter sent via HealthLink re lactose intol + SIBO, request indiv plan to balance sx control and nutrtion.  

3. SIBO  
- Mild sx only, no red flags, no repeat abx now.  
- Plan longer review 4–6/52 to go through GI pattern, dietitan input, consider repeat breath test / gastro re-referral if deteriation.  

